Z||000016||DreXteR||11-28-2001||10:52 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Mach10:<BR><B><P>AHAHAHAHAHAHA <BR>[/raucous laughter]<BR>Seriously? Q3s interface is primitive, the weapons repetitive... It's FAST, I'll give it that, but unimaginative. Q2 OWNS Q3... UT spanks them both.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>LOL!!! I never saw a tournament that pay $40,000 just for the 1st place in UT. That only happened in Q3. That means that UT is for lil kids that cant keep up with real skilled players. BTW, in Q2 you can use bots and another type of cheatting stuff to try to be @ the same level that the elite players. Or maybe you pc cant provide some real frames to play. Do you homework. BTW, Q3 is used for benchmarks, that means that will torture you pc = you will need to have a good pc to play it decent. Now days almost any pc can run it, I asuming that have a GeForce and a SB live @ least. <P>Anyway if you like UT cool, I prefer Quake 3.<P>PS Rocks and Rails.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>DreX<BR><p>[This message has been edited by DreXteR (edited 11-28-2001).]||||reg||1
